00:36:32.920 --> 00:36:36.170
I hope she's like a wife to what you've been, like a sister.

00:36:36.170 --> 00:36:38.530
We've understood each other so well.

00:36:38.530 --> 00:36:41.740
Brothers should never separate.

00:36:41.740 --> 00:36:45.170
