00:36:45.170 --> 00:36:47.890
Don't say that. No one can replace you.

00:36:47.890 --> 00:36:51.630
If you leave, the circus will be without soul, without life.

00:36:51.630 --> 00:36:54.490
No, Roberto. The circus is the family.

00:36:54.490 --> 00:36:56.830
All of us are the circus.

00:36:56.830 --> 00:37:00.000
It lives in our blood.

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:03.140
I need to stop.

00:37:03.140 --> 00:37:05.770
A home, a home with children who don't skip,

00:37:05.770 --> 00:37:09.650
