Goodbye, goodbye, my heart has a owner.

00:56:39.180 --> 00:56:43.070
They call me "the one who died"

00:56:43.070 --> 00:56:47.150
because I am Carta Breva when I take a walk.

00:56:47.150 --> 00:56:50.030
From south to north, there has not been a heart

00:56:50.030 --> 00:56:52.930
that does not loosen due to the look of this man.

00:56:52.930 --> 00:56:57.680
I will dance and only I will sting flowers.

00:56:57.680 --> 00:57:00.000
I take virutas dancing in the living room.

00:57:00.160 --> 00:57:04.880
I'm a good hand, my good friend, if in a trance I play the heart

00:57:04.880 --> 00:57:12.070
Who could be a florist to adorn it with that seductive branch?

00:57:12.070 --> 00:57:23.120
I go to the mass for your eyes and that little mouth that God gave you

00:57:23.120 --> 00:57:27.460
That for you the cabaret is played whole

01:00:26.460 --> 01:00:27.520
We're going to catch the train.

01:00:33.580 --> 01:00:40.400
- And mom, how is she? - She's strong, she thinks of us and that gives her encouragement.

01:00:40.400 --> 01:00:46.360
- Lucinda stayed with her? - Yes, she has done very well to see her.

01:00:46.360 --> 01:00:59.890
- Of course, so many joys passed and without flavors together, we should not have separated.

01:01:01.340 --> 01:01:03.640
I let myself be kidnapped by the Chilean mission.

01:01:04.890 --> 01:01:07.180
- Damn it. - He has news.

01:01:07.800 --> 01:01:12.780
- Do you know where he is? - He went after his illusion.

01:01:14.070 --> 01:01:15.510
Go and find out where he is.

01:01:23.650 --> 01:01:28.130
- And you? Where are you going? - With Circo Volta.

01:01:28.710 --> 01:01:30.000
I heard the news in Corrientes.

01:01:30.760 --> 01:01:35.250
- Why don't you stay with us, Carlos? - No, not anymore.

01:01:35.250 --> 01:01:45.730
I'm going to another place, to another life.

01:01:45.730 --> 01:01:48.710
It's not fair that you lose your life waiting.

01:01:48.710 --> 01:01:51.540
Why don't you think a little about yourself?

01:01:51.540 --> 01:01:56.830
Now less than ever, I can't leave my people.

01:01:56.830 --> 01:02:00.000
After this catastrophe, you've seen it.

01:02:01.560 --> 01:02:07.590
Ruka, everyone ran to find out about Dad.

01:02:07.590 --> 01:02:14.240
If people are united, people are circus.

01:02:14.240 --> 01:02:20.410
And I can't leave them, Neito.

01:02:20.410 --> 01:02:22.790
That's why I want to get rid of your commitment.

01:02:22.790 --> 01:02:24.160
Here.

01:02:36.240 --> 01:02:41.160
- My little sister. Nita, my daddy, crazy. - But big.

01:02:41.160 --> 01:02:46.160
Crazy of joy, the businessman Aguirre proposes that we debut in his cell.

01:02:46.160 --> 01:02:48.620
- What did he say? - When, son?

01:02:48.620 --> 01:02:57.680
- Immediately, little sister, a contract for a long time. - A long time.

01:03:08.000 --> 01:03:11.200
Forgive me, I'm a selfish man.

01:03:11.890 --> 01:03:16.550
I'm excited about working in the theater and I forget about everything.

01:03:17.510 --> 01:03:22.050
- I won't accept it. - I'll go with you, Roberto.

01:03:22.790 --> 01:03:27.590
- No, Nita. - Say yes.

01:03:28.450 --> 01:03:30.000
I can't keep sacrificing yourself like this.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:35.350
Corre, contesta que sí.

01:03:35.350 --> 01:03:49.930
Así son mis hijos, mi buena Anita.

01:03:49.930 --> 01:03:52.070
Estoy orgullosa.

01:03:52.070 --> 01:04:00.000
No iremos de pueblo en pueblo, sino de ciudad en ciudad.

01:04:22.750 --> 01:04:24.520
Bring me a basket of flowers.

01:05:04.860 --> 01:05:09.390
They just brought me this waltz, it's splendid, but I think it's better for your voice.

01:05:09.390 --> 01:05:11.630
- Is something wrong? - No, why?

01:05:11.630 --> 01:05:13.630
- Mita, your number. - I'm going.

01:05:13.630 --> 01:05:16.800
We'll talk later.

01:05:30.060 --> 01:05:33.950
- No, Mom. - You have to sing "Better than ever".

01:05:33.950 --> 01:05:39.780
- Yes, Mom. - Let's go somewhere else.

01:05:39.780 --> 01:05:42.780
- Let's go to another party. - No, no, no.

01:05:42.780 --> 01:05:46.780
- We're going in the other car. - That's it, let's go.

01:05:46.780 --> 01:05:48.780
- You go, I'm not going. - What are you saying?

01:05:48.780 --> 01:05:50.790
- I'm not going. - Stop talking nonsense.

01:05:50.790 --> 01:05:53.790
- It won't be interesting with me. Let's walk. - I'm not going, Edith.

01:05:53.790 --> 01:05:57.790
- Well, if you don't want to come, don't come. - Let's see if you won't make the night bitter.

01:05:57.790 --> 01:06:00.000
Look what I'm going to do.

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:02.240
to get sentimental for a year.

01:06:03.520 --> 01:06:05.960
- Stay with your memories. - Bye, Maracuyo!

01:06:06.040 --> 01:06:07.970
- Bye, Maracuyo! - Bye, Maracuyo!

01:06:30.190 --> 01:06:33.310
until a young man who fell in love with me

01:06:33.490 --> 01:06:36.690
took me one day with him to tango

01:06:36.870 --> 01:06:40.450
it was my obsession in the tango of that day

01:06:40.610 --> 01:06:43.870
in which my soul with anxiety surrendered

01:06:44.030 --> 01:06:46.980
because when I danced I felt in my heart

01:06:47.140 --> 01:06:51.280
that a sweet illusion was born

01:06:51.350 --> 01:06:57.650
it was such a soft, beautiful and strange melody

01:07:03.160 --> 01:07:04.680
I dreamt of a heart

01:07:35.820 --> 01:07:49.230
so my gallant that later sinking into the mud gave me to understand that he was going to abandon me, my heart of

01:07:49.230 --> 01:08:00.000
sorrow, pain, with solitude and calm looked in the cabaret, but when dancing I felt in the heart that my voice

01:08:14.360 --> 01:08:18.850
- Rodrigo? - Where did Rodrigo go?

01:08:18.850 --> 01:08:20.740
- I've seen Rodrigo. - In this dressing room.

01:08:20.740 --> 01:08:25.510
- I'm very sorry for this man. He went in there. - Roberto.

01:08:25.510 --> 01:08:30.000
- Anita is going to finish her number, Eduardo. We have little time. - Yes, yes.

01:08:30.920 --> 01:08:34.320
You are a good man, I know what will be the happiness of my sister.

01:08:35.190 --> 01:08:39.200
She has sacrificed herself a lot for us, wait for her here.

01:08:39.200 --> 01:08:40.120
Thank you.

01:09:03.230 --> 01:09:29.700
- I'm so fucking tired. - I'll take you to the bus.

01:09:34.090 --> 01:09:37.240
- You wanted to talk to me about Ibal? - After this act.

01:10:04.320 --> 01:10:07.320
I know it's for your own good and I just want your happiness.

01:10:07.320 --> 01:10:10.320
And we've come for that, Nita, to wish you happiness.

01:10:10.320 --> 01:10:11.320
Thank you.

01:10:11.320 --> 01:10:12.320
Yes.

01:10:12.320 --> 01:10:15.320
We've come together to separate ourselves.

01:10:15.320 --> 01:10:18.140
Roberto is going to Europe, you with your husband.

01:10:18.140 --> 01:10:22.110
Why don't you come with us, mom? There's still time.

01:10:22.110 --> 01:10:23.110
No, no.

01:10:23.110 --> 01:10:30.000
I'll stay with Lotto, my Tati, Carlos, and I'll stay with my husband.

01:10:30.760 --> 01:10:32.020
They need me.

01:10:32.820 --> 01:10:37.870
In the circus, I always have the illusion of seeing your father.

01:10:40.510 --> 01:10:43.000
Good luck, ma'am, it's going to be fine.

01:10:43.200 --> 01:10:45.000
- Congratulations, little girl. - Thank you.

01:10:45.200 --> 01:10:47.000
- Bye. - Bye.

01:10:49.360 --> 01:10:51.060
Take care, take care.

01:10:51.260 --> 01:10:53.260
- Take good care of yourself. - Have a good trip.

01:10:53.460 --> 01:10:55.160
- Have a good trip. - Bye, ma'am.

01:10:55.360 --> 01:10:57.330
Have a good trip, congratulations.

01:10:57.770 --> 01:10:59.000
Bye, Roberto.

01:11:00.000 --> 01:11:04.130
- May you be happy, sister. - May your dreams come true.

01:11:04.130 --> 01:11:06.470
Our dreams.

01:11:40.270 --> 01:11:44.110
♪ In Buenos Aires, they call me El Forteñito ♪

01:11:44.110 --> 01:11:49.200
♪ El Criollo, my friend, who was born in this land ♪

01:12:07.390 --> 01:12:26.180
Remember my life leaving my wounded soul and thorns in my heart

01:12:39.880 --> 01:12:50.790
the abandonment of those who are and who loved you so much and you betrayed me I forget today now if I still love you

01:13:09.210 --> 01:13:19.840
Those lips painted red have deceived me like a heart

01:13:45.230 --> 01:13:48.450
I don't want to lie and see my name again in a show.

01:13:48.450 --> 01:13:50.790
Oh, I'm a little nervous.

01:13:50.790 --> 01:13:51.790
Why, mommy?

01:13:51.790 --> 01:13:55.290
Because your mommy hasn't worked in the theater for many years.

01:13:55.290 --> 01:13:56.780
And are you afraid?

01:13:56.780 --> 01:13:57.780
No, honey, no.

01:13:57.780 --> 01:13:59.280
Oh, I forgot.

01:13:59.280 --> 01:13:59.860
What?

01:14:00.000 --> 01:14:01.400
I received a letter from my aunt and Lotto.

01:14:01.400 --> 01:14:02.400
Good news?

01:14:02.400 --> 01:14:03.900
Yes, they work at the Circus of Carlos.

01:14:03.900 --> 01:14:04.900
From another uncle?

01:14:04.900 --> 01:14:07.720
Yes. The letter is brief, but optimistic.

01:14:08.610 --> 01:14:13.600
Try to calm her down. She has some nerves too, after so many years.

01:14:13.600 --> 01:14:17.310
I'm like the night we have Juan Cuello.

01:14:17.310 --> 01:14:21.310
I'm going with them to the stage, huh? Kiss the mommy and wish her good luck.

01:14:21.830 --> 01:14:24.330
I want to stay with mommy and uncle.

01:14:24.330 --> 01:14:26.350
No, no, no, no, no.

01:14:26.350 --> 01:14:28.350
It's okay, mommy.

01:14:28.350 --> 01:14:29.890
Very strong, mommy.

01:14:30.760 --> 01:14:32.760
- Bye! - Bye!

01:14:32.760 --> 01:14:48.530
Chida, did you know something?

01:14:48.530 --> 01:14:52.120
He went to Spain.

01:14:52.120 --> 01:14:56.620
Poor Chida.

01:14:56.620 --> 01:15:00.000
What a beautiful night.

01:15:00.670 --> 01:15:05.820
like the one in which, crossing the Pampa with the carts, we were fooling around.

01:15:05.820 --> 01:15:09.410
Do you remember? Your art, my home.

01:15:09.410 --> 01:15:11.280
We achieved our wishes.

01:15:11.280 --> 01:15:15.480
That's right. Our dreams became reality.

01:15:15.480 --> 01:15:19.680
But reality is always inferior to the dream itself.

01:15:19.680 --> 01:15:26.220
- You're happy, aren't you? - Yes, but...

01:15:26.220 --> 01:15:29.340
in the peace of the home, the days are so similar.

01:15:30.000 --> 01:15:36.070
the applause in the theater always sounds the same sometimes I miss that continuous

01:15:36.070 --> 01:15:45.830
rolling the cart and I think I would have been happy with chile far from the theater today I feel

01:15:45.830 --> 01:15:54.860
the loneliness of my triumph under the circus tent we were happy and we did not know life has

01:15:54.860 --> 01:16:00.000
limits and dreams do not have the time

01:16:01.440 --> 01:16:03.440
and we will sing with the same emotion as other times.

01:16:30.280 --> 01:16:39.000
if he approaches with the tip of his tongue, I beg him to give his forgiveness to my little precaution.

01:16:39.000 --> 01:16:42.280
- I was forgiven by you. - Thank you, sir.

01:16:42.280 --> 01:16:43.700
There is nothing to be sorry about.

01:16:43.700 --> 01:16:48.810
The good Lord is going to take you to the higher heaven.

01:16:48.810 --> 01:16:54.160
Oh, I don't know what's going on with me, it makes me blush to tell you.

01:16:54.160 --> 01:17:00.000
My sky, my beautiful Uri, you'll see what's going on here.

01:17:00.000 --> 01:17:02.480
And you will appreciate my heart

01:17:02.480 --> 01:17:04.480
Filled with cotton

01:18:59.210 --> 01:19:00.000
A little to the right.

01:19:00.090 --> 01:19:02.890
- That's good. - Mr. Ministro, the lights.

01:19:03.090 --> 01:19:04.970
- Recording? - Recording.

01:19:05.170 --> 01:19:07.020
- Electrician! - Silence!

01:19:07.140 --> 01:19:12.130
In this scene, when you hear the child's cry, you get nervous and hurt Marietta.

01:19:12.330 --> 01:19:16.020
- No, no. It wasn't like that, sir. - It doesn't matter.

01:19:16.220 --> 01:19:20.020
- What do you mean, it doesn't matter? The reality changes. - The reality.

01:19:20.220 --> 01:19:22.020
The reality only serves to inspire.

01:19:22.220 --> 01:19:25.840
- The cinema creates its truth, a cinematographic truth. - But it's that...

01:19:26.040 --> 01:19:30.000
The cinema has its demands. If Tito hurts his wife, at the same time...

01:19:30.000 --> 01:19:32.260
The audience will like it more. It has more emotion.

01:19:32.260 --> 01:19:35.810
But it wasn't like that, sir.

01:19:35.810 --> 01:19:39.640
- Roberto, Roberto. - What?

01:19:39.640 --> 01:19:47.750
Don't be impulsive. This is a circus that is not a circus.

01:19:47.750 --> 01:19:50.270
- What? - Let them do it their way.

01:19:50.270 --> 01:19:54.250
But it will evoke a life that was not that of our parents, nor ours.

01:19:54.250 --> 01:19:59.440
- It won't be them, nor will it be us. - It doesn't matter, maybe it has something of our spirit.

01:20:00.190 --> 01:20:05.010
This is another world, a world that we don't understand.

01:20:05.010 --> 01:20:07.830
- And you? - After this scene, it's our turn.

01:20:07.830 --> 01:20:11.220
- Listen, Mom... - Silence, all the light, film.

01:20:11.220 --> 01:20:16.200
Attention, camera, action.

01:21:15.800 --> 01:21:19.590
Don't be a circus, something that dad hasn't been able to do yet.

01:21:19.590 --> 01:21:20.310
How?

01:21:20.310 --> 01:21:28.360
I don't know, something of ours that reflects our life, our land, something that is healthy.

01:21:34.250 --> 01:21:35.510
They are fine, aren't they?

01:21:35.510 --> 01:21:37.910
How can they not be?

01:21:37.910 --> 01:21:43.040
If they are your children, they make your dreams come true.

01:21:43.040 --> 01:21:45.760
You will live in their memory.

01:21:45.760 --> 01:21:53.870
They made us never be happy.

01:21:53.870 --> 01:21:59.730
Look at Rita.

01:22:00.830 --> 01:22:03.670
The carts that carry our illusions

01:22:05.630 --> 01:22:07.620
while the children's ones grow.
